  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.174",
   "en": "I've got no interest in petty treasure. I want something truly amazing."
  },
  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.175",
   "en": "So I decided to make this Cube my own."
  },
  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.176",
   "en": "But to make this Cube mine, you lot were a thorn in my side."
  },
  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.177",
   "en": "So I rounded up Imagin and Dopants."
  },
  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.178",
   "en": "After I lost at the Colosseum, I ran into this man here, see."
  },
  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.179",
   "en": "And that's when he let me in on his plan to take you guys down."
  },
  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.180",
   "en": "That's right. And now I've struck this one down."
  },
  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.181",
   "en": "Something this fun? No way I wasn't gonna get in on it! Hahaha!"
  },
  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.182",
   "en": "Now... this is the end. Be devoured by me!"
  },
  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.184",
   "en": "Tch... Failed again this time, huh... Next time for sure... I'll devour you all..."
  },
  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.186",
   "en": "As Gaoh was destroyed, the Imagin and Dopants he had gathered scattered and fled."
