  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.123",
   "note": "Speakers from Quest024.bla, row = TextIdOffset+N+1 (calibrated on +2 Ankh -> 0.3, +124 Gaoh -> 0.125, +186 Ankh -> 0.187; 0.126/0.183/0.185 empty). Leader blocks in Pt_Chara_Check order: Momotaros, Shotaro, OOO, RX, Rider 1, Zero, Mebius, Taro, Seven, Ultraman, Nu, Zeta, God, Wing Zero, 00. 0.123/0.124 = Wing Zero/00 tail of the 0.110-0.124 block (same English as quest_027)."
