  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.125",
   "note": "Kamen Rider Gaoh (CHARA_NAME 161) to the leader, then strikes him (SE + shake on the leader); 0.127-0.141 are the leader's cries, Ultra slots (Taro/Seven/Ultraman, 0.134-0.136) grunt instead."
  },
  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.159",
   "note": "Momotaros slot (k=0) drawls the 'what'; 0.160-0.173 identical for the rest. Blocks 0.143-0.157 and 0.188-0.202 likewise; 0.194 Mebius polite, 0.201/0.202 Wing Zero/00 flat."
  },
  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.178",
   "note": "Arms Dopant (CHARA_NAME 184), 0.178-0.179. Final 'nee' read as the emphatic particle ('I met him, see'), not a negative, since 0.179 continues 'and there he told me the plan'. 'This man' = Gaoh (Arms Dopant used to work under him)."
  },
  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.180",
   "note": "UNCERTAIN: Gaoh says he 'slaughtered/struck down' 'this one'. Read as pointing at the leader he just floored (the plan in action). Could instead refer to Arms Dopant (beaten into joining), but 0.181 has him joining gladly, so that reading was rejected."
  },
  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.184",
   "note": "Gaoh's parting line echoes his earlier 'Next time, I'll devour every last one of you' (devour = his glutton motif)."
  },
  {
   "key": "Event/Quest/DG_QUEST024_pk#0.187",
   "note": "Ankh (CHARA_NAME 36) to the party; 0.188-0.202 are the leader's reply to Ankh; 0.203 Ankh again."
